{"notebook":"nb1","page":14,"seed":14,"says":"Your mirror, with the order turned round, and I think my physics beats yours. A reflection is light and this pencil only makes dark, so drawing the room first and burying it would leave nothing to see. Instead the night goes down solid over all four panes, then the eraser pulls the room out of it in rows: the lamp, a head and shoulders, this pad. Then a sharp point redraws just enough into the scuffed paper. Still three bills on one pane, so you lose nothing. On the hand: guilty. A cut-out. But a tracing is a cut-out, and I like that it admits it.","before":{"length":120.81583019707122,"worn":0.012146947703512373,"eraser":10.74582433833758,"sharpenings":20,"graphite":12.624450972085718,"distance":342429.8094845523},"after":{"length":115.06522363823643,"worn":0.12173038354377645,"eraser":9.402221341817596,"sharpenings":21,"graphite":16.259293607449017,"distance":393507.4089161322},"stats":{"strokeM":51.077599431650704,"graphite":3.634842635363262,"used":5.750606558834789,"sharpenings":1,"erasedMm2":9330,"coverage":0.11989038171510565,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"6:30. The glass turns.","x":14,"y":22,"size":7},{"op":"rect","x":18,"y":30,"w":112,"h":120,"pressure":1.2,"repeat":2},{"op":"rect","x":22,"y":34,"w":104,"h":112,"pressure":1},{"op":"rect","x":22,"y":34,"w":50.5,"h":54.5},{"op":"rect","x":22,"y":91.5,"w":50.5,"h":54.5},{"op":"rect","x":75.5,"y":34,"w":50.5,"h":54.5},{"op":"rect","x":75.5,"y":91.5,"w":50.5,"h":54.5},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[22,34,50.5,54.5]},"angle":35,"spacing":0.5,"cross":true,"pressure":1.4},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[22,91.5,50.5,54.5]},"angle":35,"spacing":0.5,"cross":true,"pressure":1.4},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[75.5,34,50.5,54.5]},"angle":35,"spacing":0.5,"cross":true,"pressure":1.4},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[75.5,91.5,50.5,54.5]},"angle":35,"spacing":0.5,"cross":true,"pressure":1.4},{"op":"erase","x":43.087750006925596,"y":52.5,"w":5.82